Package: miREA
Title: Network-Based Edge-Centric MicroRNA-Oriented Enrichment Analysis
Version: 0.99.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zhesi", "Zhang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "zhesizhang07@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-9869-9455")),
    person("Xin", "Lai", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4913-5822")),
    person("Tampere University", role = "fnd",
           comment = "PROFI6 Health Data Science program"))
Description: miREA performs microRNA-oriented enrichment analysis by modeling
    miRNA-gene interaction (MGI) networks directly, rather than collapsing
    them to miRNA- or gene-level sets. It implements four node-based methods
    and five edge-based methods spanning over-representation, scoring-based,
    topology-aware, and network-propagation approaches, using
    expression-informed MGI edge scores to characterize regulatory strength.
    The package also provides heatmap, Sankey, and summary visualizations to
    explore miRNA-gene-pathway regulatory mechanisms discovered by the
    enrichment results.
